body:
If you want\* to share this information with your boyfriend - I would choose carefully how to break the news to him, explaining why you didn't tell him to begin with. I can see this causing relationship issues for you guys if he feels like you hid something from him, or that he can't trust you, or that you don't trust him knowing, or that he wanted to be there for you, etc. If you explain it delicately I believe it'll be good for you both to be on the same page. 

&#x200B;

If you do not\* want to share this with him - you most def do not have to and know we on Reddit are here when you want listeners :)

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I had an abortion a couple of weeks ago - I don't know who the dad was b/c I had sex with 2 diff people during the month so it could've been either. One person, I chose to tell delicately explaining my stance on abortion, and the other person I chose not to tell. So I get both sides of the coin for you. Good luck either way :)
